[
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Before we dive in today, I want to explain what we'll be working on for the next few minutes.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.66
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "This part of our session is focused on defining the problem clearly and beginning to set a realistic goal.",
    "start": 7.021,
    "end": 12.361
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "The idea isn't to solve everything right now, but to slow things down and get a shared, concrete understanding of what's actually happening.",
    "start": 13.101,
    "end": 20.782
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I'll ask some guiding questions, and you can take your time answering.",
    "start": 21.422,
    "end": 24.262
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "How does that sound?",
    "start": 24.522,
    "end": 25.222
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "That sounds good.",
    "start": 26.882,
    "end": 27.622
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Honestly, it might actually help a lot because right now everything does feel a bit overwhelming.",
    "start": 28.042,
    "end": 32.162
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "That makes sense.",
    "start": 33.682,
    "end": 34.303
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "When things feel overwhelming, breaking them into clearer pieces can make them feel more manageable.",
    "start": 34.743,
    "end": 39.823
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "To start us off, in one or two sentences, what problem are you hoping we can define together today?",
    "start": 40.403,
    "end": 46.623
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I guess the main problem I'm hoping we can define is whether it’s realistic for me to move my mom into my house.",
    "start": 47.783,
    "end": 53.164
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "She’s not doing well on her own, and I just need to figure out if that’s even the right step.",
    "start": 53.684,
    "end": 57.824
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Okay, so at a high level, the problems about your mother, Linda, living situation and whether moving her into your home is feasible.",
    "start": 58.864,
    "end": 66.405
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Let's slow that down and look at the facts.",
    "start": 67.085,
    "end": 68.785
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "First, who are the main people involved in this situation?",
    "start": 69.425,
    "end": 72.765
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Well, it’s mainly me, my mom—her name is Linda—and then my partner, Alex, who lives with me.",
    "start": 74.665,
    "end": 80.166
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "And I also have a sister, Megan, who’s out of state but definitely involved in the decision-making.",
    "start": 80.806,
    "end": 86.486
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "You, your mother Linda, your partner Alex, and your sister Megan.",
    "start": 87.306,
    "end": 90.467
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Let's focus for a moment on your mom.",
    "start": 91.007,
    "end": 92.467
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "What's going on for her right now that makes us feel urgent?",
    "start": 93.227,
    "end": 95.907
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Well, Linda’s 74 and she’s still mentally sharp, but physically she’s been declining.",
    "start": 99.247,
    "end": 104.328
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "She’s had a couple of falls in the last six months, and that’s really what’s making it feel urgent.",
    "start": 104.768,
    "end": 109.188
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "So she's physically declining, recent falls, and what about the doctor?",
    "start": 111.768,
    "end": 115.948
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Yeah, exactly.",
    "start": 118.869,
    "end": 119.649
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "And her primary care doctor, Dr. Susan Patel, has been telling us she’s at a higher risk for a serious injury if we don’t make some changes soon.",
    "start": 119.889,
    "end": 127.109
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Got it.",
    "start": 128.429,
    "end": 128.809
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "And so, concerns raised by Dr. Patel as well.",
    "start": 129.569,
    "end": 132.01
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "That helps clarify the risk.",
    "start": 132.23,
    "end": 134.17
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Where is your mom currently living and how far away is that from you?",
    "start": 134.19,
    "end": 136.85
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "She’s currently living alone in her house over in Cherry Hill, New Jersey.",
    "start": 138.31,
    "end": 141.71
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "It's about a 45-minute drive from where I am, so not exactly close enough to just drop by easily.",
    "start": 142.21,
    "end": 147.251
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "That distance makes quick support harder.",
    "start": 149.191,
    "end": 151.671
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Now let's talk about your living situation.",
    "start": 152.411,
    "end": 154.111
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "What does your home look like right now?",
    "start": 154.191,
    "end": 155.891
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Sure.",
    "start": 157.251,
    "end": 157.752
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "So right now, my partner Alex and I have a three-bedroom house in West Philadelphia.",
    "start": 157.772,
    "end": 161.812
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "We use one bedroom for ourselves, one as my office, and the third is kind of a storage-slash-guest room.",
    "start": 162.512,
    "end": 167.972
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "There are stairs, both upstairs and down, so it’s not really set up for someone with mobility issues right now.",
    "start": 168.492,
    "end": 173.693
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Okay, so space exists, but it's not currently set up for someone with mobility challenges.",
    "start": 175.373,
    "end": 180.173
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Let's add a timeline to this.",
    "start": 180.973,
    "end": 182.253
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Is there something that makes us feel like it has to happen now versus later?",
    "start": 182.313,
    "end": 185.934
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Yeah, there is.",
    "start": 187.454,
    "end": 188.134
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Basically, my mom’s property tax bill is coming up in about four months, and my sister Megan is really pressing me to figure out a plan before then.",
    "start": 188.414,
    "end": 195.494
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Plus, every time my mom falls, it just makes the whole situation feel more urgent.",
    "start": 196.134,
    "end": 200.075
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "So there's a four-month window, pressure from Megan, and increasing anxiety after each fall.",
    "start": 201.175,
    "end": 205.535
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Now I want to gently shift us to challenges.",
    "start": 206.375,
    "end": 208.515
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "When you imagine your mom moving in, what feels most difficult or concerning?",
    "start": 208.795,
    "end": 212.676
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I think a lot of things come to mind.",
    "start": 215.196,
    "end": 217.456
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Losing privacy is a big one—my partner Alex and I are used to having our own space.",
    "start": 217.476,
    "end": 221.416
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I also worry that I’ll end up becoming a full-time caregiver without really meaning to, and honestly, my mom can be pretty critical.",
    "start": 222.116,
    "end": 228.757
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "So there are some emotional and relationship challenges that make it feel hard.",
    "start": 229.117,
    "end": 232.737
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "That's a lot to hold.",
    "start": 234.257,
    "end": 235.197
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I'm hearing concerns about privacy, relationship strain, caregiver burden, and emotional history with your mom.",
    "start": 235.437,
    "end": 241.018
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Let's pause for a moment on the emotional side.",
    "start": 241.798,
    "end": 243.818
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "What feelings come up for you when you think about the situation?",
    "start": 244.258,
    "end": 246.958
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I guess a lot of guilt comes up first.",
    "start": 248.858,
    "end": 251.238
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I feel guilty for even hesitating because I want to do the right thing.",
    "start": 251.258,
    "end": 254.419
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "But there’s also fear—fear of how it might change my life or my relationship.",
    "start": 255.159,
    "end": 259.739
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "And I guess I feel some resentment too, which I’m not proud of, but it’s there.",
    "start": 260.419,
    "end": 263.599
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I really appreciate you saying that out loud.",
    "start": 265.999,
    "end": 267.42
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Feeling guilt and resentment at the same time is actually very common in situations like this.",
    "start": 267.72,
    "end": 271.6
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Naming those emotions helps us keep them from silently driving decisions.",
    "start": 272.0,
    "end": 275.36
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Now, before we talk about solutions, I want us to work toward a realistic goal for this stage.",
    "start": 276.24,
    "end": 280.46
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Not fix everything, but something more concrete.",
    "start": 281.061,
    "end": 283.641
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Based on what we've discussed, what do you think you need clarity on first?",
    "start": 284.301,
    "end": 287.881
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "I think I need to know if moving her in is even the right option, or if there are other alternatives I’m not considering because of guilt or pressure.",
    "start": 291.221,
    "end": 298.802
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Basically, I need clarity on what’s realistic for everyone involved before making any big decisions.",
    "start": 299.502,
    "end": 304.642
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "That's a very clear and thoughtful goal.",
    "start": 305.182,
    "end": 307.082
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Let me reflect what I'm hearing and see if this fits.",
    "start": 307.622,
    "end": 311.183
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Right now, the problem isn't how do I move your mom in tomorrow, but rather how do you make a well-informed, realistic decision about Linda's living situation that balances her safety, your capacity, and your household's needs.",
    "start": 311.203,
    "end": 324.684
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Does that capture it?",
    "start": 325.064,
    "end": 325.804
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Yeah, that really does capture it.",
    "start": 328.244,
    "end": 329.824
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "It feels like a relief to frame it that way, because it's more about making an informed decision rather than rushing into anything.",
    "start": 330.084,
    "end": 336.045
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Thanks for putting it that way.",
    "start": 336.605,
    "end": 337.565
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "Good.",
    "start": 338.125,
    "end": 338.405
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "So for this phase, our goal might be to gather enough information and clarity over the next few months to decide whether Linda moving in is realistic, and if not, what other options exist.",
    "start": 338.945,
    "end": 347.825
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "How does that sound as a starting goal?",
    "start": 348.445,
    "end": 349.866
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "That sounds really doable and a lot less overwhelming.",
    "start": 351.426,
    "end": 354.206
  },
  {
    "audio_path": "C:\\Users\\rpaul\\Documents\\GitHub\\Audio_Transcription_Deidentification\\Audio_Local_tests\\audio_files\\gpt_test.m4a",
    "text": "It definitely helps to have a clear goal like that to work towards.",
    "start": 354.846,
    "end": 383.508
  }
